Gstreamer
  debian    install GStreamer 1.24 or newer with apt
  ubuntu    install GStreamer 1.24 or newer with apt
  fedora    install GStreamer 1.24 or newer with dnf
  arch      install GStreamer 1.24 or newer with pacman
  suse      install GStreamer 1.24 or newer with zypper
  nixos     run qrec from its Nix package, which ships gst_all_1.gstreamer · [gst_all_1.gstreamer]
