  void      install GStreamer 1.24 or newer with xbps-install
  gentoo    install GStreamer 1.24 or newer with emerge
  unknown   install GStreamer 1.24 or newer with your distribution's package manager
  nix shell $ nix develop · the flake provides gstreamer
